# JapanProTips project memory

## Product

- **Site:** JapanProTips (`https://japanprotips.com`)
- **Audience:** Tourists and residents in Japan; practical guides, not a travel agency
- **Repo package name:** `japanprotips` (Next.js 15, React 18, Tailwind 3, TypeScript)

## Structure

- `app/guides/<slug>/page.tsx` — visitor guides indexed in `lib/tourist-guides.ts` (plus internal MDX tests; resident guides live under `/residents`), shared `app/guides/layout.tsx` (sticky eSIM CTA)
- `app/residents/<slug>/page.tsx` — resident guides (custom layout, no `GuideArticleShell`)
- `app/tourists/page.tsx` — hub; cards from `lib/tourist-guides.ts`
- `components/guides/GuideArticleShell.tsx` — conversion shell for most guides
- `components/conversion/` — eSIM, hotel, comparison table, affiliates
- `lib/site.ts`, `lib/editorial-copy.ts`, `lib/guide-search-index.ts`

## Do unless the user explicitly asks otherwise

- Match existing editorial patterns (cream/paper, Vollkorn + Barlow, `article-body` class)
- Keep changes scoped; no drive-by refactors or full site rebuilds
- Only commit or push when the user requests it

## Do not assume

- MDX is not set up yet; do not bulk-migrate guides without a phased plan (see `mdx-content-roadmap` rule)
- No dynamic `app/guides/[slug]` route yet; each guide is its own folder
